# i18n & messages

## Layout

```
messages/shared/{locale}.json     # home, common, dsa
messages/apps/{slug}/en.json      # English source of truth per app
messages/apps/{slug}/{locale}.json  # optional overlay (deep-merge)
```

App folders are listed in `i18n.ts` (`APPS`). Loader: `lib/loadAppMessages.ts`.

Typical keys: `hero` (include `seoTitle`, `metaDescription`, `structuredDataDescription`), `download`, `privacy`, `terms`, `features`, `faq.items`, `howToUse`.

## Legal sections

```json
"privacy": {
  "title": "Privacy Policy",
  "lastUpdated": "Last updated: May 2026",
  "intro": "...",
  "section1": { "title": "...", "content": "...", "items": ["..."] },
  "sectionContact": { "title": "Contact", "email": "zuki.apps.dev@gmail.com", "address": "..." }
}
```

Render with `LegalSections`.

## Rules

- New copy: English file first; other locales inherit
- Home carousel: `messages/shared/en.json` → `home.{namespace}` must match the product page
- Invalid JSON or missing `t()` keys → runtime 500 — mirror keys used in `page.tsx`
- Surgical patches only (no whole-file reformat)
